== Interpretation ==
The printer has a lifetime history of 66 paper mispick events.
ProductStatusDyn reports alert-table changes with modification number 6.
HP web services are intentionally disabled, so HP Connected/Instant Ink panel prompts should stay cleared.
EventMgmt shows the most recent device-side event categories above.
There is no active printer-side fault being reported through CUPS, IPP, or ProductStatusDyn right now.
If print jobs still sit in 'printing' for a long time while the checks above remain healthy, the next suspects are network delivery, Bonjour name resolution, or the printer taking a long time to rasterize a specific job.

